    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-13E52ACA6C67A3E2-Q1">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분과 발음이 같은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분과</keyword>
        <keyword>발음</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Все знают Больш&lt;u&gt;о&lt;/u&gt;й театр.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 강세 모음 о의 발음
정답은 ④이다. тоже의 о는 강세를 받아 [о]로 발음된다. Большой의 о도 강세 모음이므로 [о]로 발음된다. 강세가 없는 о는 [а] 또는 [ə]로 약화된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Эт&lt;u&gt;о&lt;/u&gt; русская семья.</choice_text>
          <commentary>это의 어말 о는 비강세로 [ə]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Д&lt;u&gt;о&lt;/u&gt;ма здесь красивые.</choice_text>
          <commentary>дома(복수 домá)의 첫 о는 비강세로 [а]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>На ст&lt;u&gt;о&lt;/u&gt;ле лежит книга.</choice_text>
          <commentary>столе의 о는 비강세로 [а]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Все знают Больш&lt;u&gt;о&lt;/u&gt;й театр.</choice_text>
          <commentary>강세 모음 [о]이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-13E52ACA6C67A3E2-Q2">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 공통으로 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>공통으</keyword>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>идёт</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · идти의 관용적 쓰임
정답은 ①이다. идти는 '(옷이) 어울리다(тебе идёт)', '(수업이) 진행되다(идёт урок)', '(비가) 오다(идёт дождь)'의 뜻으로 쓰인다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>идёт</choice_text>
          <commentary>идёт이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>летит</choice_text>
          <commentary>летит은 날아간다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>бежит</choice_text>
          <commentary>бежит은 달린다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>носит</choice_text>
          <commentary>носит은 지니거나 입고 다닌다는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-13E52ACA6C67A3E2-Q3">
      <question_stem>다음 설명이 의미하는 단어는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>설명</keyword>
        <keyword>의미하</keyword>
        <keyword>단어</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>чаевые</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · чаевые
정답은 ②이다. 고객이 계산서 금액 외에 서비스 종사자에게 주는 돈은 팁(чаевые)이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>сдача</choice_text>
          <commentary>сдача는 거스름돈이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>чаевые</choice_text>
          <commentary>чаевые이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>наличные</choice_text>
          <commentary>наличные는 현금이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>карточка</choice_text>
          <commentary>карточка는 카드이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2018년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-13E52ACA6C67A3E2-Q4">
      <question_stem>㉠, ㉡에 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
