      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>в баскетбол на скрипке</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · играть в / на
정답은 ③이다. 운동·게임은 играть в + 대격(в баскетбол), 악기 연주는 играть на + 전치격(на скрипке)을 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>на баскетбол в скрипке</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치사가 뒤바뀌었다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>на баскетбол в скрипку</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치사와 격이 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>в баскетбол на скрипке</choice_text>
          <commentary>в баскетбол, на скрипке이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>в баскетболе на скрипке</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠의 격이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
